HakiOS device fragment for Tecno Spark 20 Pro
KJ6 / MediaTek MT6789
CONFIG_DEVICE="kj6"

Touchscreen is reported as fts_ts, but the HakiOS transport is unverified.
Enable only after the KJ6 touch driver exists.
CONFIG_HAKIOS_TCM=y
Power and volume key mapping not yet identified.
CONFIG_BUTTONS=0

CPU frequency driver not yet ported.
CONFIG_MTK_CPUFREQ=0

Mali-G57 MC2; MT6768 Mali-G52 driver must not be reused.
CONFIG_MALI=y
CONFIG_MALI_MHZ=0

Display: 1080x2460, 120 Hz.
CONFIG_FBSCALE=1
CONFIG_FBFIT=0
CONFIG_FB_QUEUE=0
CONFIG_FB_FLIP=y
CONFIG_FB_INUSE=y
CONFIG_SURF_ALIGN=y
CONFIG_SURF_LOCKWAIT=y
Sensor hub not yet ported.
CONFIG_SCP_STEP=0

Storage/root image not yet implemented.
CONFIG_EMMC_ROOT=y
CONNSYS not yet ported.
CONFIG_CONNSYS_STEP=0

No unverified device-specific boot arguments.
CONFIG_BOOTARGS=""
